      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 45\u2011foot high, 500\u2011foot long dam creates the lake, while a smaller 7\u2011acre Big Bass Lake sits nearby for fishing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
