      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Holiday Lakes offers two sandy beaches: a 500\u2011by\u2011140\u2011foot main beach and a 200\u2011by\u2011100\u2011foot east beach.",
